      "cooked": "<p>How to restric a normal user to use this pick column feature in Erpnext Report.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/2/c209e86be0a57a983bce1442d2757d38ff462b70.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/c209e86be0a57a983bce1442d2757d38ff462b70\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/2/c209e86be0a57a983bce1442d2757d38ff462b70.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"rGxR7G91BUQbA2tSVD7pbybQJUs\" width=\"178\" height=\"201\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">178×201 4.08 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>And Also the Add Column inside Reports</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/b/3b47aafff1163c79afaa8516f464cb1462342226.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/3b47aafff1163c79afaa8516f464cb1462342226\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/b/3b47aafff1163c79afaa8516f464cb1462342226.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"8spIyz3J3j7t3MoYcA0KIvC6pa6\" width=\"179\" height=\"135\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">179×135 5.19 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
